    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6636" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναίσχυντος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shameless, impudent,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Alc.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				21.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IA</u>
				327
			</span></i>, etc., <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				182
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				And.
				4.17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				671c
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ap.</u>
				17b
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			), etc.:—<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ
				ἀναίσχυντον,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναισχυντία</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IA</u>
				1144
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ap.</u>
					31b
				</span></i>
			: 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναισχυντότατα ἀνθρώπων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					27.18
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of things,
				<i>shameful, abominable,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βορά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Cyc.</u>
					416
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θῆκαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.52
				</span></i>
			.</div>
